{"product_id":"vaporesso-luxe-x-kit","title":"Vaporesso Luxe X Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Vaporesso Luxe X vape kit is a pocket-sized device that offers a genuine sub ohm vape. Though it’s small, it features a 1500mAh built-in battery that provides long vaping sessions on just a single charge. The 5 - 40W variable output lets you select a level of vapour production that suits you best. It also means that while the included Luxe X pods can support DTL (Direct To Lung) vaping, the kit is also compatible with MTL (Mouth To Lung) pods from the same range.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSub Ohm \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-kenya\" title=\"Pod Vape Kit\"\u003ePod Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1500mAh Built-in Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5 - 40W Output Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL \u0026amp; DTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe device has a single firing button that’s used to activate it, so there’s no need to click through multiple buttons and menus. It also features intelligent chipset technology, so you won’t have to worry about setting the correct wattage for your coil, as the kit selects it for you based on what coil you’ve selected. If you’re looking to experiment, you can also manually set a power output and discover a vape that suits your preferences.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eA top filling design makes refilling your kit with e-liquid easy, as you don’t even have to remove the pod from the device. Plus, it also features adjustable airflow which gives you the option of experiencing a tighter or looser inhale. The coils built into the pods feature a mesh design, which each heats more e-liquid at a faster rate for improved flavour. Though the 0.4 Ohm pod creates more vapour than the 0.8 Ohm version, we recommend a 70% VG e-liquid or higher with either.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBox Contains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso Luxe X Vape Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.4 Ohm Vaporesso Luxe X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8 Ohm Vaporesso Luxe X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215378487,"sku":"V Luxe X Pod Kit","price":5200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit-min.jpg?v=1752512510","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-luxe-x-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




